      "parameters": {
        "content": "# LexIA — Legal Document Analysis Assistant\nPowered by NVIDIA Nemotron 3 (Ultra + Lightning) and Nemotron Embed.\n\n1\\) Upload a document through the form. 2) Ask your questions in the chat.\n\nBoth parts share the `legal_documents` vector store.\n\n**The two flows are independent and communicate through the shared vector store.**",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 1168,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f3153b94-b289-4f43-bc9f-c5760d7ab74e",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Document upload\nOpen the form and upload a PDF, DOCX or TXT file. The text is split into chunks, embedded with NVIDIA Nemotron Embed and stored in the `legal_documents` vector store.",
        "height": 736,
        "width": 1168,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "6a23d15b-b14a-422a-9e55-a88f440af6e3",
